00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,828
Each pair has a path difference of a by two sine theta.

2
00:00:03,828 --> 00:00:08,802
If that is half a wavelength, the two wavelets of every pair cancel.

3
00:00:08,802 --> 00:00:15,143
Every wavelet from the top half is wiped out by its partner from the bottom half, and P is dark.

4
00:00:15,143 --> 00:00:18,645
That happens when a sine theta equals lambda.

